      <p>Manufacturer documentation supports Brio+ features including Intelligent 4D Massage, Automatic Body Scan, True Zero Gravity, infrared heat, full-body air massage, L-track design, wall hugging, USB power port, and Intelligent Touch Foot Rollers. The brio+ massage chair often shortlists alongside DualTech 4D Dual when buyers are choosing between everyday comfort and advanced full-body performance.</p>
