      <h2>Comfort &amp; Daily Use Experience</h2>
      <p>Comfort feedback usually decides whether a Positive Posture massage chair becomes a daily-use chair or sits unused. The most consistent ownership notes are the same across models: the chair has to feel right in the first 10 minutes, the recline has to fit the room, and the controls have to be easy enough to use without thinking.</p>
      <p>For everyday households, Brio+ and DualTech 4D Dual are usually the strongest fit. For shoppers who want value and design over feature depth, Solara is the cleaner pick. Test the full recline arc in a showroom — small differences in seat depth, foot extension, and shoulder line change the daily-use experience significantly.</p>
