      <p>Positive Posture 4D massage chair intensity varies by model. DualTech and DualTech Pro AI deliver the strongest, most layered massage feel through dual mechanisms and AI-assisted personalization. Brio+ is more balanced — deep enough for daily use without being aggressive. Brio Sport leans into recovery-style pressure with heated rollers and compression.</p>
