<!-- FAQ -->
<section class="ppr-section ppr-section-alt" id="ppr-faq">
  <div class="ppr-narrow">
    <div class="ppr-section-header"><span class="ppr-eyebrow">Common Questions</span><h2>Frequently Asked Questions About Positive Posture</h2><p>Positive Posture review, brand, model, price, warranty, and showroom questions — answered without filler.</p></div>
    <div class="ppr-faq-list" id="ppr-faq-list">

      <div class="ppr-faq-item"><div class="ppr-faq-q" onclick="this.parentElement.classList.toggle('open');var a=this.nextElementSibling;a.style.maxHeight=a.style.maxHeight?null:a.scrollHeight+'px'"><h3>Are Positive Posture massage chairs worth it?</h3><button class="ppr-faq-toggle" aria-label="Toggle">+</button></div><div class="ppr-faq-a"><div class="ppr-faq-a-inner"><p>For buyers who use the chair consistently, Positive Posture massage chairs can offer strong value because they become part of a daily relaxation routine. The right model matters: Solara fits value/design shoppers, Brio+ fits everyday comfort with 4D massage, Brio Sport is the sport massage chair option, and DualTech / DualTech Pro AI 4D fit shoppers seeking more advanced massage performance.</p></div></div></div>

      <div class="ppr-faq-item"><div class="ppr-faq-q" onclick="this.parentElement.classList.toggle('open');var a=this.nextElementSibling;a.style.maxHeight=a.style.maxHeight?null:a.scrollHeight+'px'"><h3>Is Positive Posture a good massage chair brand?</h3><button class="ppr-faq-toggle" aria-label="Toggle">+</button></div><div class="ppr-faq-a"><div class="ppr-faq-a-inner"><p>Positive Posture is a good massage chair brand for buyers who want a balance of comfort, design, zero gravity recline, full body air massage, and model variety. It is especially strong when shoppers can compare models in a showroom and choose based on body fit, room size, intensity preference, and budget.</p></div></div></div>

      <div class="ppr-faq-item"><div class="ppr-faq-q" onclick="this.parentElement.classList.toggle('open');var a=this.nextElementSibling;a.style.maxHeight=a.style.maxHeight?null:a.scrollHeight+'px'"><h3>Which Positive Posture massage chair is best?</h3><button class="ppr-faq-toggle" aria-label="Toggle">+</button></div><div class="ppr-faq-a"><div class="ppr-faq-a-inner"><p>There is no single best Positive Posture chair for every buyer. DualTech 4D Dual is often shortlisted for full-body performance, DualTech Pro AI 4D for premium technology, Brio+ for everyday comfort and value, Brio Sport for recovery routines, and Solara as the value/design option.</p></div></div></div>

      <div class="ppr-faq-item"><div class="ppr-faq-q" onclick="this.parentElement.classList.toggle('open');var a=this.nextElementSibling;a.style.maxHeight=a.style.maxHeight?null:a.scrollHeight+'px'"><h3>What is the best Positive Posture chair for daily use?</h3><button class="ppr-faq-toggle" aria-label="Toggle">+</button></div><div class="ppr-faq-a"><div class="ppr-faq-a-inner"><p>For daily use, Brio+ and DualTech 4D Dual are strong options for buyers who want more complete massage performance, while Solara may fit shoppers who want a more accessible value/design option. The best choice depends on how often you will use the chair, how much intensity you prefer, and whether you want advanced massage sessions.</p></div></div></div>

      <div class="ppr-faq-item"><div class="ppr-faq-q" onclick="this.parentElement.classList.toggle('open');var a=this.nextElementSibling;a.style.maxHeight=a.style.maxHeight?null:a.scrollHeight+'px'"><h3>What is the difference between Positive Posture Brio+ and Brio Sport?</h3><button class="ppr-faq-toggle" aria-label="Toggle">+</button></div><div class="ppr-faq-a"><div class="ppr-faq-a-inner"><p>Brio+ is positioned as an everyday comfort and value-performance chair with 4D massage, L-track design, True Zero Gravity, full body air massage, infrared heat, and a USB charging port. Brio Sport is the sport massage chair option with a stronger recovery-routine framing — heated rollers, compression, and post-activity relaxation. Brio Sport should not be presented as medical treatment.</p></div></div></div>

      <div class="ppr-faq-item"><div class="ppr-faq-q" onclick="this.parentElement.classList.toggle('open');var a=this.nextElementSibling;a.style.maxHeight=a.style.maxHeight?null:a.scrollHeight+'px'"><h3>Does Positive Posture offer full body air massage?</h3><button class="ppr-faq-toggle" aria-label="Toggle">+</button></div><div class="ppr-faq-a"><div class="ppr-faq-a-inner"><p>Yes. Key Positive Posture models include full body air massage or targeted air compression zones. When comparing models, check shoulder, arm, hip, calf, and foot coverage because each model's air massage layout can feel different.</p></div></div></div>

      <div class="ppr-faq-item"><div class="ppr-faq-q" onclick="this.parentElement.classList.toggle('open');var a=this.nextElementSibling;a.style.maxHeight=a.style.maxHeight?null:a.scrollHeight+'px'"><h3>Do Positive Posture chairs have zero gravity?</h3><button class="ppr-faq-toggle" aria-label="Toggle">+</button></div><div class="ppr-faq-a"><div class="ppr-faq-a-inner"><p>Yes, key Positive Posture models include True Zero Gravity recline. DualTech describes True Zero Gravity recline as elevating the legs and distributing weight for relaxation, while Solara and Brio+ also include True Zero Gravity recline.</p></div></div></div>

      <div class="ppr-faq-item"><div class="ppr-faq-q" onclick="this.parentElement.classList.toggle('open');var a=this.nextElementSibling;a.style.maxHeight=a.style.maxHeight?null:a.scrollHeight+'px'"><h3>What does track design mean in a massage chair?</h3><button class="ppr-faq-toggle" aria-label="Toggle">+</button></div><div class="ppr-faq-a"><div class="ppr-faq-a-inner"><p>Track design refers to the roller path inside the chair. L-track or extended track designs can affect how far the massage reaches across the neck, back, glutes, and hamstrings. It is one reason showroom testing matters.</p></div></div></div>

      <div class="ppr-faq-item"><div class="ppr-faq-q" onclick="this.parentElement.classList.toggle('open');var a=this.nextElementSibling;a.style.maxHeight=a.style.maxHeight?null:a.scrollHeight+'px'"><h3>Do Positive Posture chairs have a USB charging port?</h3><button class="ppr-faq-toggle" aria-label="Toggle">+</button></div><div class="ppr-faq-a"><div class="ppr-faq-a-inner"><p>Some Positive Posture models include a USB charging port, which can be useful if you listen to music, podcasts, or guided relaxation during massage sessions. Check the specific model page before purchase.</p></div></div></div>

      <div class="ppr-faq-item"><div class="ppr-faq-q" onclick="this.parentElement.classList.toggle('open');var a=this.nextElementSibling;a.style.maxHeight=a.style.maxHeight?null:a.scrollHeight+'px'"><h3>Can I try Positive Posture massage chairs in store?</h3><button class="ppr-faq-toggle" aria-label="Toggle">+</button></div><div class="ppr-faq-a"><div class="ppr-faq-a-inner"><p>Yes. For high-ticket massage chairs, it is better to try massage chairs in store when possible. A showroom visit helps you compare body fit, massage intensity, zero gravity recline, foot rollers, heat, and overall comfort before buying.</p></div></div></div>

      <div class="ppr-faq-item"><div class="ppr-faq-q" onclick="this.parentElement.classList.toggle('open');var a=this.nextElementSibling;a.style.maxHeight=a.style.maxHeight?null:a.scrollHeight+'px'"><h3>What should I ask before buying Positive Posture massage chairs online?</h3><button class="ppr-faq-toggle" aria-label="Toggle">+</button></div><div class="ppr-faq-a"><div class="ppr-faq-a-inner"><p>Ask about delivery, installation, hallway measurements, warranty, after-sale service coverage, return policy, and whether trained technicians are available in your area. These details matter as much as price when choosing a high-ticket massage chair.</p></div></div></div>

      <div class="ppr-faq-item"><div class="ppr-faq-q" onclick="this.parentElement.classList.toggle('open');var a=this.nextElementSibling;a.style.maxHeight=a.style.maxHeight?null:a.scrollHeight+'px'"><h3>Are Positive Posture chairs good for back and neck tension?</h3><button class="ppr-faq-toggle" aria-label="Toggle">+</button></div><div class="ppr-faq-a"><div class="ppr-faq-a-inner"><p>Many shoppers look at Positive Posture for back, neck, shoulder, and lower-back relaxation. These chairs may help users relax and unwind as part of a daily routine, but they should not be presented as medical treatment.</p></div></div></div>

      <div class="ppr-faq-item"><div class="ppr-faq-q" onclick="this.parentElement.classList.toggle('open');var a=this.nextElementSibling;a.style.maxHeight=a.style.maxHeight?null:a.scrollHeight+'px'"><h3>Is the foot massage intense on Positive Posture chairs?</h3><button class="ppr-faq-toggle" aria-label="Toggle">+</button></div><div class="ppr-faq-a"><div class="ppr-faq-a-inner"><p>It can be. Foot rollers may feel strong at first, especially for sensitive feet. Start with lower intensity and test the feature in a showroom before deciding which model to buy.</p></div></div></div>

      <div class="ppr-faq-item"><div class="ppr-faq-q" onclick="this.parentElement.classList.toggle('open');var a=this.nextElementSibling;a.style.maxHeight=a.style.maxHeight?null:a.scrollHeight+'px'"><h3>Do Positive Posture chairs fit small rooms?</h3><button class="ppr-faq-toggle" aria-label="Toggle">+</button></div><div class="ppr-faq-a"><div class="ppr-faq-a-inner"><p>Some models are designed with space-saving or wall-hugging features. DualTech requires about 3 inches from the wall when upright, and Solara describes a roughly 0.6-inch wall-hugging design. Measure the room, doorway, hallway, and reclining clearance before delivery.</p></div></div></div>

      <div class="ppr-faq-item"><div class="ppr-faq-q" onclick="this.parentElement.classList.toggle('open');var a=this.nextElementSibling;a.style.maxHeight=a.style.maxHeight?null:a.scrollHeight+'px'"><h3>Should I buy Positive Posture massage chairs online or visit a showroom?</h3><button class="ppr-faq-toggle" aria-label="Toggle">+</button></div><div class="ppr-faq-a"><div class="ppr-faq-a-inner"><p>For high-ticket massage chairs, showroom testing is strongly recommended. Massage intensity, foot roller feel, body fit, and zero gravity experience are easier to judge in person than from specs alone.</p></div></div></div>

    </div>
  </div>
</section>

